      "number": 2,
      "title": "Simplify leaderboard copy and expand domain names",
      "body": "Remove the introductory accuracy/uncertainty/efficiency paragraph and the six-metrics status description. Display Average Treatment Effect, Conditional Average Treatment Effect, and Difference-in-Differences / Synthetic Control in the navigation and domain headings, and expand the no-JavaScript fallback names.\n\nPreserve loading-error messages, result data, method names, references, and table behavior. Update the existing mobile title checks.\n\nValidation: JavaScript syntax, Python compilation, and DOM rendering checks across all 10 domains passed; table and reference markup match the previous version exactly.",
