    {
      "number": 4,
      "title": "Add benchmark cards for five StatArena domains",
      "body": "## Changes\n\n- Add benchmark cards for ATE, CATE, Instrumental Variables, Proximal Causal Inference, and Difference-in-Differences. Each card describes the estimand, data downloads, baseline commands, evaluation metrics, and prediction format.\n- Link each card from its domain leaderboard and include all five directories in the GitHub Pages build.\n- Document that ATE and CATE labels were previously published, that IV and DiD provide public scoring archives, and that Proximal scoring uses separately held labels.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Checked the navigation states for all ten domains, staged page routes and anchors, Hugging Face release paths, JavaScript syntax, and the chart regression.\n- Ran the IV starter baseline and scorer on both development and reference test studies.\n- The browser suite could not launch Chromium in this environment. The existing reported-release test fails on its homepage-title assertion on both the base commit and this branch.",
