      "number": 5,
      "title": "Clarify benchmark card protocols and IV release details",
      "body": "## Changes\n\n- Clarify the ATE/CATE pairing metadata, prior disclosure, starter-only DGP documentation, and two-file scoring instructions.\n- Clarify the Proximal leaderboard display scale and link original-unit results.\n- Document DiD bootstrap resplitting and the evaluation reported in the linked checkpoint's model card.\n- Pin the IV dataset revision. Sync the card and leaderboard protocol with the v0.3 release, including the two interval constructions, 2,000 studies, and 50 random-forest refits. All displayed score values are preserved.\n- Describe how to confirm the public GitHub issue for a model link.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Re-ran the five starter tasks on their development and reference-test splits, checked official input and submission files, and matched reference metrics for IV against the leaderboard.\n- Verified that the deployed cards matched the initial merge, and checked the revised card anchors, IV release links, JavaScript syntax, IV method details, and chart regression.",
