      "number": 8,
      "title": "Propose a proximal linear-bridge simulation (workflow pilot)",
      "body": "## StatArena data contribution\n\n**Track** · Simulated DGP\n\n**Case file** · `data-submissions/simulated-dgp/submissions/proximal-linear-bridge.md`\n\n**Summary** · A literature-based proximal linear-bridge scenario with latent confounding, observable proxies and an analytic constant CATE reference. This is a contribution/reviewer workflow pilot for a mechanism already represented in the earlier internal collection, not a claim of a new catalog mechanism or new model scores.\n\n**Materials** · [Cui et al., open manuscript v4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2011.08411v4), Section 5.1, equation (13), Appendix H; [journal DOI](https://doi.org/10.1080/01621459.2023.2191817). Full generator, exact parameters/seeds, reference derivation, provenance and local verification receipt are prepared for private maintainer/reviewer review. Please confirm the private handoff route and assign a proximal reviewer. No protected implementation or per-task reference is attached publicly.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] This PR adds or updates one case under the corresponding track's `submissions/` directory.\n- [ ] The case follows the track template and describes its assumptions, data source and evaluation target.\n- [ ] I checked what can be shared in this public PR and kept restricted materials in the agreed private review channel.\n",
      "state": "open",
      "draft": false,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/Statsinference/statsinference.github.io/pull/8",
